00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:57.500
Kalau begitu, aku makan di luar saja.

00:02:57.766 --> 00:02:58.766
Ya, paham.

00:02:58.866 --> 00:02:59.866
Hati-hati di jalan.

00:03:07.533 --> 00:03:11.966
Aoi-san, kubantu ya.

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:14.033
