00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.600
Hei, isap lagi.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:33.900
Kayak bayi, isap lagi yang kuat.

00:06:34.966 --> 00:06:36.233
Nggak boleh, nggak boleh.

00:06:37.233 --> 00:06:38.266
Mesum.

00:06:38.733 --> 00:06:39.733
Udah kubilang nggak boleh.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.900
Udah ngaceng banget, tuh.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.200
Nggh.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.933
Udah kubilang nggak boleh, Aoi-san.

00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:03.800
Jangan lakuin hal kayak gitu. Aoi, jangan. Ayah?

00:07:04.566 --> 00:07:05.366
Jangan, Aoi.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.500
Ayah.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.100
Aoi, hey.

00:07:09.733 --> 00:07:10.733
Jangan. Ha?

00:07:10.733 --> 00:07:12.066
Jangan lakuin hal kayak gitu.

