Habisnya, enggak ada di cucian sama sekali.

00:09:09.066 --> 00:09:11.800
Dih, ih. Hal kayak gitu yang dipikirin?

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.100
Iya, maaf.

00:09:13.366 --> 00:09:17.766
