00:12:24.833 --> 00:12:25.833
Ayah.

00:12:26.166 --> 00:12:27.166
Aoi-san.

00:12:28.433 --> 00:12:30.366
Ada apa jam segini?

00:12:33.033 --> 00:12:35.300
Ah, nggak bisa tidur.

00:12:36.033 --> 00:12:38.600
