Hei, Aoi, tolong ambilkan bir dong.

00:26:57.633 --> 00:26:57.733
Hah?

00:26:58.066 --> 00:26:59.066
Siang bolong begini?

00:26:59.666 --> 00:27:01.333
Biarin, hari ini kan libur.

00:27:01.800 --> 00:27:02.800
Minum yuk.

00:27:25.466 --> 00:27:29.133
Sayang, kalau tidur di situ nanti masuk angin lho.

00:27:30.533 --> 00:27:32.633
Padahal gak kuat minum.

00:27:36.266 --> 00:27:38.100
Dia pasti capek karena kerja.

00:27:39.233 --> 00:27:40.400
Biarin dia tidur saja, ya?

00:27:42.133 --> 00:27:43.133
Iya juga ya.

00:28:05.366 --> 00:28:14.666
Kalau ayahku masih hidup, aku pasti pengen minum bareng.
Ah, benar juga ya.

00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:27.500
Aoi, ambilkan camilan.

00:28:29.300 --> 00:28:34.000
