00:29:14.033 --> 00:29:15.033
Mau, kan?

00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:33.633
Ayah mesum banget, ya. Aoi-chan.

00:29:35.100 --> 00:29:35.400
..

00:29:39.233 --> 00:29:40.433
Gimana kalau dia bangun?

00:29:45.166 --> 00:29:46.166
